        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Inertia & Delay</strong></p>\n<p>Means to act. Will, definitely, right after this. The power was always coming — it just comes on its own schedule, and that schedule rewards followers who don't rush it.</p>\n<p><strong>Areas of Concern</strong> inertia, delay, patience rewarded</p>\n<p><strong>Edicts</strong> never act before you must; let things come due on their own schedule</p>\n<p><strong>Anathema</strong> rush a task the god hasn't gotten to yet; act out of panic instead of patience</p>\n<p><strong>Religious Symbol</strong> an hourglass, sand barely moving</p>\n<p><strong>Sacred Animal</strong> tortoise</p>\n<p><strong>Sacred Colors</strong> dust grey, faded amber</p>"
